[{:db/id "q-8360/selection/07a360a82ba6e5a7c8b552d8bd23520c8119df942c8a411fffccd6630e7efe7c" :answer/id #uuid "cd231e8b-fddb-5596-b172-1d4684b3ce8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=-2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360/selection/b0f265024022f22dedbdd1bdc7df3a760933457d3ea34c80d11a6fc946828d1b" :answer/id #uuid "3ceb329e-55a9-5c86-8bfe-ee20fd3b57a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-\\frac{1}{2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360/selection/49b485b8941c020b9a07ddd9c23b82e25263f7e5dabb0e927427c13f968bdf36" :answer/id #uuid "67f112c2-6aea-51fd-9998-90163bc7eeef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x=-\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360/selection/425b53ace7668c2430e484a02d79bf6cedc6f35e70cd4b51ba12804778874d0a" :answer/id #uuid "61c9df9f-9b53-54a0-a50c-939edf359046" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360/selection/ce9ba74438413506836630f0da3c7d4192d74e42ecb4b8a45252e6ec597924d5" :answer/id #uuid "dfa73437-0d7e-5210-9b89-3e08b4dc41c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2(\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)y=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f9f48bd-0e67-5e30-8478-edffa5bce95f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8360/selection/ce9ba74438413506836630f0da3c7d4192d74e42ecb4b8a45252e6ec597924d5" :answer-field/choices ["q-8360/selection/07a360a82ba6e5a7c8b552d8bd23520c8119df942c8a411fffccd6630e7efe7c" "q-8360/selection/b0f265024022f22dedbdd1bdc7df3a760933457d3ea34c80d11a6fc946828d1b" "q-8360/selection/49b485b8941c020b9a07ddd9c23b82e25263f7e5dabb0e927427c13f968bdf36" "q-8360/selection/425b53ace7668c2430e484a02d79bf6cedc6f35e70cd4b51ba12804778874d0a" "q-8360/selection/ce9ba74438413506836630f0da3c7d4192d74e42ecb4b8a45252e6ec597924d5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8360" :question/id #uuid "ef24453f-f045-5d0a-8ed3-0ca5b930bc74" :question/math-academy-id "q-8360" :question/problem "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=0\\,.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y\\operatorname{cot}⁡x & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{{2(\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}y & ={{-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ and $Q(x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-8360/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8360"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection/32a6a4efa4e101fde72ebeec53fcdff2bc8616e1e47b756b053fe5058a59e24f" :answer/id #uuid "56a46fe8-9518-53fc-bc8b-5e33057c268a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2{e}^{-x}y-{e}^{-2x}x=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection/3082bd34151aed12276e0c84f084a9b5e21f98613896c26790ddfffabbf69019" :answer/id #uuid "17484bfe-f934-5d3c-9c77-b9ea78107716" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-y={e}^{-2x}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection/0a8e11eb77ae0a16ba185439e3eb5b28259e9b760fa0f4b890e258386c744586" :answer/id #uuid "14ab8be4-03ca-5153-8c0c-7088d7ffafdb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y={e}^{-2x}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection/97d9a772b4a4239c06409fbaf00d06537d639e1aa0370ced2d1ebe80f3f3b174" :answer/id #uuid "d284da86-d9f8-5315-b5db-976f864dde0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2{e}^{-x}y={e}^{-2x}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection/b1c73a9af72b68010c9b95b0cec4072f651e51b049481046828d2f371b0589a4" :answer/id #uuid "a45c7eaf-12b3-56fe-82d4-fd5314e7b4c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{e}^{-2x}y-{e}^{-x}x=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0894869c-bc84-5110-ae10-0563263bcd72" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103349/selection/97d9a772b4a4239c06409fbaf00d06537d639e1aa0370ced2d1ebe80f3f3b174" :answer-field/choices ["q-103349/selection/32a6a4efa4e101fde72ebeec53fcdff2bc8616e1e47b756b053fe5058a59e24f" "q-103349/selection/3082bd34151aed12276e0c84f084a9b5e21f98613896c26790ddfffabbf69019" "q-103349/selection/0a8e11eb77ae0a16ba185439e3eb5b28259e9b760fa0f4b890e258386c744586" "q-103349/selection/97d9a772b4a4239c06409fbaf00d06537d639e1aa0370ced2d1ebe80f3f3b174" "q-103349/selection/b1c73a9af72b68010c9b95b0cec4072f651e51b049481046828d2f371b0589a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-103349" :question/id #uuid "6070c390-c527-5587-a620-4ee028211b12" :question/math-academy-id "q-103349" :question/problem "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n{e}^{2x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2{e}^{x}y-x=0\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{2x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2{e}^{x}y-x & =0 \\\\ {e}^{2x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2{e}^{x}y & =x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{{(2{e}^{-x})}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}y & ={{{e}^{-2x}x}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=2{e}^{-x}$ and $Q(x)={e}^{-2x}x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-103349/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103349"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-8359"] :question/problem "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2x-y}{x}\\,.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2x-y}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2x}{x}-\\frac{y}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & +\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{2x}{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & +{{\\frac{1}{x}}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}y={{2}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=\\frac{1}{x}$ and $Q(x)=2.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection/9a34e5980c32e0172fe3bc546b459b4e80ae870ae328f77088f6dfb72e07fc80" :answer/id #uuid "a7a5b571-7dc4-55fc-95b4-794b2cf751c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x)y=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection/829f1bdecf4ecdfc8de1b156bffbe853e4adac6e12bd8172d463b62d6cf8a093" :answer/id #uuid "cf6a7f40-b2a6-5fd4-9b0f-2e5200133a8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection/9ce1102cce7bbad0263709e3af637c3ee60c0bd878798822235335bff18da6b1" :answer/id #uuid "b73c2a1a-ae93-5d95-a7f2-5a426699abed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)y=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection/ebd0e71056a8231c2fc6be3ccf9c2b0c4c88f106b83ed0659632b69c55c767d5" :answer/id #uuid "982f6313-1aff-5013-864c-7f870615840d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=(\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection/ddc44d8a97449289181cef285b5c8e1cb4af74f96768b5e06602143563fad872" :answer/id #uuid "2269ae32-16f1-57f5-940e-8b5cbf1d092a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x)y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7642a827-a0ad-568b-ba36-f985cbc48b0f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103354/selection/9ce1102cce7bbad0263709e3af637c3ee60c0bd878798822235335bff18da6b1" :answer-field/choices ["q-103354/selection/9a34e5980c32e0172fe3bc546b459b4e80ae870ae328f77088f6dfb72e07fc80" "q-103354/selection/829f1bdecf4ecdfc8de1b156bffbe853e4adac6e12bd8172d463b62d6cf8a093" "q-103354/selection/9ce1102cce7bbad0263709e3af637c3ee60c0bd878798822235335bff18da6b1" "q-103354/selection/ebd0e71056a8231c2fc6be3ccf9c2b0c4c88f106b83ed0659632b69c55c767d5" "q-103354/selection/ddc44d8a97449289181cef285b5c8e1cb4af74f96768b5e06602143563fad872"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-103354" :question/id #uuid "1de67dfe-a866-57fb-b3b3-9dacfc2c3c42" :question/math-academy-id "q-103354" :question/problem "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,y=0\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,y & =0 \\\\ (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,y & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x})y & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-(\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)y & =-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{{(-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}y & ={{-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x$ and $Q(x)=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-103354/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103354"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection/409da08918c2275db9d66d57d9c6702a596591077795dc34c7da6746db3b1a37" :answer/id #uuid "0ed56dab-049e-5c4b-ba10-c8a03243f80d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dx}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection/3a3939e73b6cc0dc2596cff4f098268b8a9741bb4e51c251734290586bac6a0d" :answer/id #uuid "f1b3e5f7-7eb7-5511-81b1-23c5b6aea1a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dx}+y\\,{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2}={(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection/4172c7c6d066172640d27a2e8b43aab37b87717d9404344ac1eb35ba87d19fb2" :answer/id #uuid "6a4a410c-9ad1-5027-bb91-c23197893d52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dx}+y\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection/b7266a8e4e04a5d280313f1a5a43e1d6d6920d248ae76e017b0e1614dce7c2d1" :answer/id #uuid "42d23912-7fe2-56fc-8591-337db7f05398" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dx}+4y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection/b65b6ac9a1a658a7f962536ef5fa0f8833e4fde4d0d823949981d79fedc5fb61" :answer/id #uuid "a01982d2-9f85-569c-8517-2a0d4aed07ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dx}+2y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "76a95351-2164-5d4a-84eb-f7670061af50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-16401/selection/b65b6ac9a1a658a7f962536ef5fa0f8833e4fde4d0d823949981d79fedc5fb61" :answer-field/choices ["q-16401/selection/409da08918c2275db9d66d57d9c6702a596591077795dc34c7da6746db3b1a37" "q-16401/selection/3a3939e73b6cc0dc2596cff4f098268b8a9741bb4e51c251734290586bac6a0d" "q-16401/selection/4172c7c6d066172640d27a2e8b43aab37b87717d9404344ac1eb35ba87d19fb2" "q-16401/selection/b7266a8e4e04a5d280313f1a5a43e1d6d6920d248ae76e017b0e1614dce7c2d1" "q-16401/selection/b65b6ac9a1a658a7f962536ef5fa0f8833e4fde4d0d823949981d79fedc5fb61"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-16401" :question/id #uuid "aa9b6eb5-384a-59f1-95c3-f2beb341858b" :question/math-academy-id "q-16401" :question/problem "Write the following first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+{y}^{2}{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2}={(1-y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2}\\,.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}+{y}^{2}{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2} & ={(1-y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{dy}{dx}+{y}^{2}{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2} & =1+{y}^{2}{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}^{2}-2y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ \\frac{dy}{dx} & =1-2y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ \\frac{dy}{dx}+{{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\\,y & ={{1}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ and $Q(x)=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-16401/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de671ee-7bba-54ce-bec2-d2d6f5569f4a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-16401"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103554/selection/50ae1790b5f4d60741b9a4de92ce40f84d9c0dec591aadf8ed9384c3bf900f43" :answer/id #uuid "3f225529-def3-54e2-bfe2-a307d38b0b28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\frac{{e}^{x}}{x}y={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103554/selection/f59f65391078ffed0f2fac72f2782b313c81d9317eb24cf6a3d73ae54ac04190" :answer/id #uuid "fff47300-ef22-525e-a49b-c6e3906d3c77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)={x}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103554/selection/8210abe46fcf231504dcc9130aca1adcc048855f974b5e162b5a0848318e71a6" :answer/id #uuid "f7f51840-b743-5f38-a266-57c6a624f8c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-{x}^{2}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103554/selection/d477f37937ba6ccbd7ac9366b9d433ce662c81fe68dbb44b68bab3718e19d163" :answer/id #uuid "de36a199-47ef-5bf5-b198-80d287b3edb6" :answer/type :answer.type/